#. module: account_interests_fiscal_position_bl
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_interests_fiscal_position_bl
msgid ""
"=========================================================\n"
"Interests with the Fiscal Position of the Overdue Invoice\n"
"=========================================================\n"
"\n"
".. \n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! This file is generated by oca-gen-addon-readme !!\n"
"   !! changes will be overwritten.                   !!\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! source digest: sha256:7f6104929fabba05e0cd0d46421b919575998c5a5cef797d82823123148ac5a9\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"\n"
".. |badge1| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/maturity-Beta-yellow.png\n"
"    :target: https://odoo-community.org/page/development-status\n"
"    :alt: Beta\n"
".. |badge2| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/license-AGPL--3-blue.png\n"
"    :target: http://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0-standalone.html\n"
"    :alt: License: AGPL-3\n"
".. |badge3| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/github-baselogica--ar%2Fbaselogica--open--addons-lightgray.png?logo=github\n"
"    :target: https://github.com/baselogica-ar/baselogica-open-addons/tree/20.0/account_interests_fiscal_position_bl\n"
"    :alt: baselogica-ar/baselogica-open-addons\n"
"\n"
"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3|\n"
"\n"
"The late payment interest of the Odoo community (``account_interests``)\n"
"makes, each period, a debit note with the interest of what each customer\n"
"owes. The note takes its fiscal position, and with it its VAT, from the\n"
"customer's form. When the form no longer says how the overdue invoices\n"
"were made, the note goes out with another VAT: a customer that buys now\n"
"without VAT and still owes an invoice made with VAT gets a note without\n"
"VAT, and the other way round. The interest is part of the price of the\n"
"sale paid late, so it carries the VAT of that sale.\n"
"\n"
"This module makes the note follow the invoices it charges:\n"
"\n"
"- **The fiscal position of the overdue invoices**: the note takes the\n"
"  one of the invoices whose interest it charges (the ones still overdue\n"
"  and, with late payment interest, the ones paid late in the period),\n"
"  not the one of the customer's form.\n"
"- **Several fiscal positions**: when the overdue invoices of a customer\n"
"  in the same company have different ones, which normal work does not\n"
"  make, the note takes the one of the largest part of the debt.\n"
"- **The taxes, as on an invoice**: the taxes of the interest product,\n"
"  mapped by that fiscal position. A branch without taxes of its own uses\n"
"  the ones of its parent company, as Odoo does on its invoices: without\n"
"  this module, the note of a branch goes out without taxes.\n"
"- **Nothing else changes**: the amounts, the lines, the journal, the\n"
"  document type and the validation stay as the interests module makes\n"
"  them.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"None. The interests are configured as without this module, in Accounting\n"
"→ Configuration → Interest Configuration: one rule per company, with its\n"
"interest product and the taxes of that product.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"Nothing changes in the daily work: the scheduled action makes the\n"
"interest notes as before, now with the VAT of the invoices they charge.\n"
"A rule without automatic validation leaves them in draft: check each one\n"
"and confirm it.\n"
"\n"
"Known issues / Roadmap\n"
"======================\n"
"\n"
"- One note per customer and company, with one fiscal position. When the\n"
"  overdue invoices of a customer in the same company carry different\n"
"  VAT, the note takes the fiscal position of the largest part of the\n"
"  debt: before confirming it, split its line by VAT with the detail of\n"
"  each invoice that the note leaves in its history.\n"
"- One VAT rate per note, the one of the interest product: a company that\n"
"  sells with two rates splits the line by rate before confirming the\n"
"  note, as without this module.\n"
"- The amounts, the periods and the document type are the ones of the\n"
"  interests module.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/baselogica-ar/baselogica-open-addons/issues>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been reported.\n"
"If you spotted it first, help us to smash it by providing a detailed and welcomed\n"
"`feedback <https://github.com/baselogica-ar/baselogica-open-addons/issues/new?body=module:%20account_interests_fiscal_position_bl%0Aversion:%2020.0%0A%0A**Steps%20to%20reproduce**%0A-%20...%0A%0A**Current%20behavior**%0A%0A**Expected%20behavior**>`_.\n"
"\n"
"Do not contact contributors directly about support or help with technical issues.\n"
"\n"
